%\vspace{1ex}}}%
%BeginExpansion
\vspace{1ex}
\begin{minted}[bgcolor=mygray,breaklines,linenos]{matlab}
ln_gap = ln_y-trend_y;
y = ln_gap-mean(ln_gap);
\end{minted}
\vspace{1ex}%
%EndExpansion


We can plot our result:%

